{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ts3ulgbi","slide":3,"name":"Google Shape;105;p3","placeholder":"body","text":"Project Name: Legend From Below\n\nProject Description:\nLegend From Below is a dungeon shooter game inspired by Soul Knight, developed using Unity.\nStory: A mysterious warrior awakens in an unknown underground dungeon filled with enemies and traps.\nObjective: Survive, fight through multiple dungeon levels, and conquer the depths.\nGameplay: fast-paced combat, dodge rolls, random chests, and resource management.","textPreview":"Project Name: Legend From Below |  | Project Description: | Legend From Below is a dungeon shooter game inspired by Soul Knight, develope...","textChars":411,"textLines":7,"bbox":[17.4,112.76,667.23,568.1]}
